          "message": {
            "text": "CFF outline tables must survive the post-subset PUA cmap rebuild too. The synthesized CFF regression test proves the rebuilt WASM retains CharStrings and the final mapped font resolves U+E000 to nonempty gid 1 ink.",
            "markdown": "CFF outline tables must survive the post-subset PUA cmap rebuild too. The synthesized CFF regression test proves the rebuilt WASM retains CharStrings and the final mapped font resolves U+E000 to nonempty gid 1 ink."
