          "guid": "msznti86guu92mfx",
          "message": {
            "text": "Use HarfBuzz’s completed-instancing representation instead of a Domotion outline fallback. HBSUBSETFLAGSDOWNGRADECFF2 is defined upstream specifically for a fully pinned CFF2 face: it emits static CFF1 while retaining the subsetter’s glyph IDs and resolved charstrings. SFIndia Telugu and Kannada reopen with byte-for-byte path commands and advances after this conversion, and both affected Unicode fixtures become pixel-clean locally. Broad svg2ttf fallback was rejected because it regressed unrelated CFF2 faces.",
            "markdown": "Use HarfBuzz’s completed-instancing representation instead of a Domotion outline fallback. `HB_SUBSET_FLAGS_DOWNGRADE_CFF2` is defined upstream specifically for a fully pinned CFF2 face: it emits static CFF1 while retaining the subsetter’s glyph IDs and resolved charstrings. SFIndia Telugu and Kannada reopen with byte-for-byte path commands and advances after this conversion, and both affected Unicode fixtures become pixel-clean locally. Broad svg2ttf fallback was rejected because it regressed unrelated CFF2 faces."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/render/hb-subset.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 108,
                  "endLine": 115,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "  let flags = HB_SUBSET_FLAGS_RETAIN_GIDS | HB_SUBSET_FLAGS_NOTDEF_OUTLINE;\n  if (!keepHinting) flags |= HB_SUBSET_FLAGS_NO_HINTING;\n  // This flag is ignored for non-CFF2 sources. For CFF2 it only takes effect\n  // when the font is fully instantiated below, yielding a static CFF table.\n  // That is HarfBuzz's own representation of a completed CFF2 instantiation,\n  // rather than a Domotion guess based on a face or codepoint.\n  if (pinAxes != null) flags |= HB_SUBSET_FLAGS_DOWNGRADE_CFF2;\n  w.hb_subset_input_set_flags(input, flags);"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
